# The Good Rod, cast from the south bank of the river on Route 205.
#
# The tile is hm-surf's, which is already known to face water: CanUseFishingRod
# refuses anywhere the tile in front is not surfable, so a rod station and a
# Surf station want exactly the same spot. Route 205 South is one of the few
# maps that carries all three rod tables (old 25%, good 50%, super 75%), so the
# three rod stations differ only in which rod is registered.
#
# The lead is a level 70 Garchomp with one move so the fight the catch starts
# is over in a turn: this station is about the rod, and a long battle would
# make it about the battle engine instead.

name ANGLER
gender GENDER_MALE
trainer-id 30008
money 3000
badge BADGE_ID_FEN
party SPECIES_GARCHOMP 70 ITEM_NONE
party-move 0 0 MOVE_DRAGON_CLAW
item ITEM_GOOD_ROD 1
register-item ITEM_GOOD_ROD
map MAP_HEADER_ROUTE_205_SOUTH 162 604 FACE_UP
